<title>JAPAN: Nomura, DKB penalties from Aug 6 to year-end--NHK.</title>
<headline>Nomura, DKB penalties from Aug 6 to year-end--NHK.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The penalties expected to be announced against Nomura Securities Co Ltd and Dai-Ichi Kangyo Bank Ltd will include a suspension of some of their businesses, and are to take effect from August 6 and run until the end of the year, NHK television reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>NHK did not quote any sources for its information.</p>
</text>
